# The QUALIFIED spelling has the same hole as the bare one, and the bug report
# did not find it: `qualify_qualified_type` also falls back to the name unchanged
# when the alias resolves to nothing, so `nosuch.Bar` became a phantom too and
# this file compiled cleanly.
#
# Both shapes must be covered by one rule, or fixing the bare case just moves the
# hole one spelling to the left.
fn width(b: nosuch.Bar) -> Int = 1

